B.alu=new A.mv("runPackages",4,"Run Packages",'Several runs paid for up front.\n\nPut the runs the hasher is buying in Runs included. Put anything you are giving away on top in Promotional credit \u2014 a package sold as "pay for ten, get eleven" is ten runs and one run of credit.',B.ain,1,"runPackages")
